function:
\[
  f = \|A\cdot x-y\|_2^{2}
\]

gradient:
\[
  \frac{\partial f}{\partial x} = 2\cdot A^\top \cdot (A\cdot x-y)
\]
where
\begin{itemize}
  \item $A$ is a matrix
  \item $x$ is a vector
  \item $y$ is a vector
\end{itemize}
